Sat Nov 14 00:28:15 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- axene-office-window-placement.patch: a docked XMayday no longer
  shows up at its own size, grows with the index pane and then
  jumps to the docked geometry: the window is mapped only once the
  index and the page are loaded and the geometry is applied.

