Fri Nov 13 01:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add axene-office-dead-keys.patch: XAllWrite and Xclamation read
  the keyboard with XLookupString, which does not compose dead keys,
  so typing accents on us-intl or ABNT2 layouts gave the spacing
  accent followed by the bare letter. Compose acute, grave,
  circumflex, tilde, diaeresis, cedilla and ring into Latin-1
  (acute + c gives c-cedilla). XQuad already composed them through
  its Motif edit bar

- axene-launcher.in: export the <APP>_LIB variable of every program,
  not only the one being started. AxeneOffice looks for the
  executables next to itself first, so it ran /usr/libexec/axene/<App>
  directly and the Help menu of programs started from the bar could
  not find the documentation

- Add axene-office-about-authors.patch: Xclamation's Help menu had
  an unlabelled "mAuthor" item whose dialog was freed with the
  About box destructor, crashing Xclamation on Ok. Remove the item
  and add a translated "Authors:" line to the About box of every
  program. The About box release line printed into its own buffer
  (overlapping sprintf), so it only showed the build date. The
  status bar font left the slant open; pin it to the oblique
  Helvetica the original screenshots show
- Require xorg-x11-fonts-legacy: without its 75/100 dpi bitmaps
  every widget falls back to the "fixed" font

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Nov 12 22:10:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add axene-office-lp64-window-ids.patch: the internal document
  window manager (WinManager.c of XAllWrite, Xclamation and XQuad)
  let XGetGeometry and XQueryTree store their root, parent and
  children results in an int cast to Window *; a Window has 8 bytes
  on x86_64, so the stack was overwritten and the programs aborted
  with "stack smashing detected" when the main window was resized
  or maximized, or when a document was iconified or arranged

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Nov 12 20:45:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add axene-office-no-launcher-killpg.patch: XAllWrite assumed it was
  started by the Axene Launcher master process whenever its parent
  was init, which is the case when the AxeneOffice bar starts it
  with system("... &"); on exit it then sent SIGUSR1 to the whole
  launching process group, killing the window manager or the X
  session. The launcher is not installed, so never assume it

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Nov 12 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Pick the language at run time from the locale (French, German,
  Spanish, English; AXENE_LANGUAGE overrides) instead of fixing
  English: one library tree per language under /usr/share/axene/lang,
  as the original installer's per-install symlinks did; the launcher
  is now Source1 (axene-launcher.in)
- Export <APP>_LIB as the original launch scripts did: the rc files
  locate the help pages through it, so the Help menu could not find
  the documentation in XMayday
- XAllWrite's German resources are incomplete upstream (beta): use
  the English ones for German

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Nov 12 19:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Axene Office 2.0.1 (XAllWrite, Xclamation,
  XQuad, XMayday and the AxeneOffice launch bar) from the GPL
  AxeneSDK 2.0.1
- Source tarball made by prune-nonfree-fonts.sh: the Adobe/Linotype
  Type 1 fonts (*.pfc) and their AFMs are not redistributable and are
  removed; the standard font names link to the URW Type 1 clones of
  ghostscript-fonts-std
- Add axene-office-modern-toolchain.patch: build with GCC 15 on
  x86_64 (varargs.h to stdarg.h, ISO token pasting, <stdint.h>
  types with the LP64 path of the old Alpha port, strerror instead
  of sys_errlist, a missing ';' and a broken string continuation)
- Add axene-office-ximage-bpp.patch: modern Xlib rejected the XImage
  used to probe bits per pixel, so 32 bpp screens were treated as
  24 bpp and loading the icons overflowed the image buffers
- Add axene-office-urw-fonts.patch: font list uses the .pfb names
- Drop editor backup files from the documentation and link the
  documentation images shared between the programs (fdupes)
